meta {
  name: List Orders
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/order
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Requires auth-service/Login.bru to have run first (needs {{accessToken}}).

  OrderService.findAll(): a ROLE_USER token only sees orders where userID equals its
  own email (orderRepository.findByUserID); a ROLE_ADMIN token
  (use {{adminAccessToken}} instead) sees every order in the table — this matches the
  MVP requirement "consultar apenas os pedidos permitidos" from CLAUDE.md.

  Expected: 200 OK with a plain array (no pagination) of the caller's own orders (or
  all orders, for an admin token).
}
